{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00561",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.93,
      "end_seconds": 10.64,
      "duration_seconds": 9.71,
      "text": "Good morning, doctor. I have come back about my left leg, as you asked me to when we last met."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 12.25,
      "end_seconds": 25.95,
      "duration_seconds": 13.7,
      "text": "Good morning, Mr. Adeyemi. I'm glad you could make it. Please, have a seat and get comfortable. How have you been getting on since then?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 26.66,
      "end_seconds": 40.45,
      "duration_seconds": 13.79,
      "text": "Quite well, thank you. A great deal calmer, I must say. I was rather frightened at the time, and my wife was even more so."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 42.69,
      "end_seconds": 54.38,
      "duration_seconds": 11.69,
      "text": "That's completely understandable. Take your time here, there's no rush at all. Has the weakness come back at any point since our last visit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 56.68,
      "end_seconds": 66.9,
      "duration_seconds": 10.22,
      "text": "No, not at all. I walked to the mailbox and back twice yesterday, simply to be certain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 68.55,
      "end_seconds": 78.04,
      "duration_seconds": 9.49,
      "text": "I like that, a careful experiment. And what about numbness in the leg or foot?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 80.56,
      "end_seconds": 83.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "None, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 84.96,
      "end_seconds": 94.44,
      "duration_seconds": 9.48,
      "text": "Good. Let's go over your medicines so the chart is right. Are you still on the same tablet as before?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 95.57,
      "end_seconds": 104.4,
      "duration_seconds": 8.83,
      "text": "Yes, amlodipine, 5 milligrams, once daily, for my high blood pressure. That is the only one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 105.82,
      "end_seconds": 113.81,
      "duration_seconds": 7.99,
      "text": "Thank you. And are there any allergies I should keep on the record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 115.27,
      "end_seconds": 127.18,
      "duration_seconds": 11.91,
      "text": "Codeine. I was allergic to it as a young man. It brought me out in hives, and I have avoided it ever since."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 129.25,
      "end_seconds": 141.06,
      "duration_seconds": 11.81,
      "text": "Hives from codeine. I'll make sure that's written clearly. Anything else in your health history besides the blood pressure?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 142.05,
      "end_seconds": 148.54,
      "duration_seconds": 6.49,
      "text": "Varicose veins in the right leg. Nothing else of note, I believe."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 151.21,
      "end_seconds": 160.99,
      "duration_seconds": 9.78,
      "text": "Perfect. Now let me check a couple of numbers, and then I'd like to test the leg myself."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 162.21,
      "end_seconds": 167.05,
      "duration_seconds": 4.84,
      "text": "Of course. Shall I roll up my sleeve?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 180.0,
      "end_seconds": 184.15,
      "duration_seconds": 4.15,
      "text": "Please. This will take just a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 186.62,
      "end_seconds": 195.32,
      "duration_seconds": 8.7,
      "text": "Blood pressure is 128 over 78, and your pulse is 70. That looks lovely."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 196.49,
      "end_seconds": 207.21,
      "duration_seconds": 10.72,
      "text": "I am relieved to hear it. I had a rather large breakfast, I confess, and I wondered whether it would show."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 208.6,
      "end_seconds": 227.24,
      "duration_seconds": 18.64,
      "text": "It certainly didn't. Now lie back on the couch for me. I'd like you to push your left foot against my hand, as hard as you can, like pressing a gas pedal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 234.47,
      "end_seconds": 238.98,
      "duration_seconds": 4.51,
      "text": "Like this? I shall do my best."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.96,
      "end_seconds": 247.87,
      "duration_seconds": 7.91,
      "text": "Excellent. The strength in your left leg is full, and just as strong as the right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 249.13,
      "end_seconds": 255.97,
      "duration_seconds": 6.84,
      "text": "That is a great comfort. May I ask what we do now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 257.14,
      "end_seconds": 275.82,
      "duration_seconds": 18.68,
      "text": "Good question. I don't want to say anything about causes yet, because I'd be guessing. What I'd like to do is arrange an MRI scan of your lower back, so we can look properly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 278.14,
      "end_seconds": 283.96,
      "duration_seconds": 5.82,
      "text": "An MRI. Is that the tube one with the loud knocking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 286.77,
      "end_seconds": 295.18,
      "duration_seconds": 8.41,
      "text": "That's the one. It's noisy but painless, and they'll give you earplugs. Takes about thirty minutes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 296.21,
      "end_seconds": 302.36,
      "duration_seconds": 6.15,
      "text": "I can manage thirty minutes, so long as nobody makes me hurry out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 304.22,
      "end_seconds": 311.72,
      "duration_seconds": 7.5,
      "text": "Nobody will. Tell the radiographer if you feel uneasy, and they'll talk you through it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 313.41,
      "end_seconds": 317.46,
      "duration_seconds": 4.05,
      "text": "Thank you. Will the appointment come by post?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 318.97,
      "end_seconds": 333.09,
      "duration_seconds": 14.12,
      "text": "Reception will phone you, and they'll send a letter as well. I'd like to see you again in four weeks to go over the scan together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 334.36,
      "end_seconds": 347.42,
      "duration_seconds": 13.06,
      "text": "Four weeks. That suits me well. My daughter lives a good way off and I should like to visit her afterwards."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 349.99,
      "end_seconds": 361.5,
      "duration_seconds": 11.51,
      "text": "That brings up the driving. For long trips, stop every two hours, get out of the car and walk about for a few minutes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 362.55,
      "end_seconds": 370.84,
      "duration_seconds": 8.29,
      "text": "Every two hours. I shall write that on a card for the dashboard."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 372.24,
      "end_seconds": 381.49,
      "duration_seconds": 9.25,
      "text": "Perfect. And should anything feel different between now and then, don't wait for the appointment, just phone the clinic."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 382.72,
      "end_seconds": 388.87,
      "duration_seconds": 6.15,
      "text": "I will, doctor. Thank you for being so patient with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 390.9,
      "end_seconds": 397.51,
      "duration_seconds": 6.61,
      "text": "It's a pleasure. Safe travels, Mr. Adeyemi, and give your wife my best."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 399.38,
      "end_seconds": 404.21,
      "duration_seconds": 4.83,
      "text": "I shall indeed. Good day to you."
    }
  ]
}
